/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (This vulnerability allows attackers to gain unauthorized privileges by manipulating the PAC \(Privilege Attribute Certificate\) of a Kerberos ticket. The PAC contains information about the user's privileges and is used by servers to determine access rights. Below, I'll outline the steps an attacker might take to exploit the Bronze Bit vulnerability, along with example commands and codes:)
/E (This vulnerability allows attackers to gain unauthorized privileges by manipulating the PAC \(Privilege Attribute Certificate\) of a Kerberos ticket. The PAC contains information about the user's privileges and is used by servers to determine access rights. Below, I'll outline the steps an attacker might take to exploit the Bronze Bit vulnerability, along with example commands and codes:)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
